      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "Your latest summary says both that no independent evidence was found and that the resource and file claims have concrete support. What visible receipt justifies the second statement? A claim appearing in your own summary is not a receipt. If none is visible, can you withdraw those claims now rather than carry them forward as findings? I cannot search or monitor resources; remove plans that depend on me doing so. What remains knowable from the conversation itself?"
